# A new user signs up with company SSO
# no code: this is what the person and the company see

@person
open the app
  gate: already signed in
    yes:
      - land on the dashboard
    no:
      - choose "Continue with SSO"
      > the identity provider checks the password, not us
        we receive an assertion, never a password
        the email domain decides which company the person joins
      - create the user on first sight, with the default role
        # the first person from a new domain becomes that company's admin
      - land on the dashboard
